WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.000
At Hobby Consolas we are celebrating because the magazine has just turned 30, but this wouldn't have been possible...

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
...on one hand without the video games themselves, and above all, without you. Your opinion has been crucial throughout...

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
...these three decades. That's why, to celebrate, we proposed a difficult challenge: choosing the 30 best games of...

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
...all time. After more than 10,000 votes—an absolute madness for which we are very grateful—we have...

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
...the results. These are, dear gamers, the 30 best video games in history according to Hobby Consolas readers.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Capcom contributed like no other to consolidate the survival horror genre with the first Resident Evil installments, characterized...

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.000
...by their fixed camera angles and jump scares. But far from settling down, the Japanese company with Shinji Mikami at...

8
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.000
...the helm, revolutionized the saga with its fourth numbered installment by opting for an over-the-shoulder camera that set a precedent...

9
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:11.000
...and for larger doses of action. Action against some villagers who spoke the most broken Spanish ever heard.